  "description": "JOKFOH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H56 N12 O16 Tb4,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.862-3.880 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.50-114.93°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H72Tb4N12O20.",
